---
import LegalPage from '../components/LegalPage.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<LegalPage
  title="Accessibility Statement | IdeaRevive"
  heading="Accessibility Statement"
  description="IdeaRevive’s commitment to an accessible website aligned with WCAG 2.2 Level AA, what we have done so far, and how to report an accessibility barrier."
  path="/accessibility/"
  summary="IdeaRevive aims for this website to meet WCAG 2.2 Level AA so everyone can use it, including people using screen readers, keyboards or reduced-motion settings. Report any barrier and we will respond within five business days."
>
  <p>{site.name} wants everyone to be able to use this website. We aim to meet the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 at Level AA.</p>
  <h2>What we have done so far</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Semantic HTML with a logical heading structure on every page.</li>
    <li>Full keyboard navigation with visible focus indicators and a skip-to-content link.</li>
    <li>Colour contrast designed to meet AA ratios for text and controls.</li>
    <li>Labelled form fields and live status messages.</li>
    <li>Animations disabled for visitors who prefer reduced motion.</li>
    <li>Content that works without JavaScript, so assistive technologies read the full page.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Known limitations</h2>
  <p>Embedded third-party content such as Google Maps may not fully meet our standards. We provide the same information in text alongside it.</p>
  <h2>Report an accessibility barrier</h2>
  <p>If you find any barrier on this site, please email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> with the page address and a short description. We will respond within five business days.</p>
  <h2>How we test the site</h2>
  <p>
    We check pages with keyboard-only navigation, a screen-reader pass on the home, contact and audit forms,
    and a reduced-motion setting. Colour contrast is measured against WCAG 2.2 AA for body text and buttons.
    New templates are reviewed against this list before they go live. The site is static HTML, so content is
    available without JavaScript.
  </p>
  <p>
    IdeaRevive is a Hyderabad digital marketing agency. Accessibility is part of how we build client websites
    too: labelled fields, visible focus, skip links and text that still makes sense if images fail to load.
    If a third-party embed fails these tests, we duplicate the important facts in text on the same page.
  </p>
</LegalPage>
